In crate: fixture-crate (0.1.0)

A type that is not thread-safe, to exercise negative auto-trait impls (!Send/
!Sync, which rustdoc synthesizes for types holding a raw pointer).

struct NotThreadSafe {
    ptr: *const u8,
}

Methods

  ◦ pub fn [new](https://docs.rs/fixture-crate/0.1.0/fixture-crate/struct.NotThreadSafe.html#method.new)(ptr: *const u8) -> Self
    Wrap a raw pointer.

